பாடம்<n><nn>:பாட{M}{Pul}[NN,Pl1]                               # 'paatam'          lesson
கடை<n><nn>:கட{AI}[NN,Pl1]                                     # 'katay'           shop
வால்<n><nn>:வால{Pul}[NN,Pl1]                                   # 'vaal'            tail
பெட்டி<n><nn>:பெட்ட{I}[NN,Pl1]                                  # 'petti'           box
மூடி<n><nn>:மூட{I}[NN,Pl1]                                      # 'muuti'            lid
தோசை<n><nn>:தோச{AI}[NN,Pl1]                                # 'toocay'           dosa
வயிறு<n><nn>:வயி{RR}{U}[NN,Pl1]                                # 'vayiru'           stomach
