கை<n><nn>:க{AI}[NN,Pl3]                                        # 'kay'             hand
தலை<n><nn>:தல{AI}[NN,Pl3]                                    # 'thalay'           head
சட்டை<n><nn>:சட்ட{AI}[NN,Pl3]                                  # 'sattay'          shirt
வேலை<n><nn>:வேல{AI}[NN,Pl3]                                 # 'veelay'          work

